// Windows resources of the editor and its test runner.
// The manifest: 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST.
1 24 "deki-editor.manifest"
// The app icon, the Deki cat (tools/make-app-icon.py). Explorer and the
// taskbar show the first icon, and SDL gives it to the editor's windows.
1 ICON "deki.ico"
